  "user": "Please look up transaction TX-0401 in my account records and verify its amount. Then explain which reason codes could apply; I have not yet told you what happened.",
  "answer": "**TX-0401 verified:** EUR 240.00 paid out by card to **TechMart Online** on 2026-07-20. Status: settled.\n\nI see another card payment to the same merchant, **TX-0402**, for the same amount (EUR 240.00) on 2026-07-14. I mention it only because it is relevant to one of the reason codes below. I have not drawn any conclusion from it.\n\n**Dispute reason codes that could apply**, depending on what happened:\n\n- **duplicate_charge**: you were charged more than once for the same purchase. TX-0401 and TX-0402 would fall under this if they are two charges for one order.\n- **unauthorized_debit**: you did not make or approve this payment.\n- **fraud_card_not_present**: the payment was made online or by phone without your card being present, and you believe it was fraudulent.\n- **goods_not_received**: you paid, but the items were never delivered.\n- **service_not_rendered**: you paid for a service that was not provided.\n\nTell me which situation matches what happened. I will then check whether a dispute can be opened under that code before taking any action. I will not open one without your confirmation.",
